<title>USA: Sioux City hogs $0.25-0.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs $0.25-0.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.25 to mostly 0.50 lower. Trade moderate. Top $59.25 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     59.00-59.25</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     58.50-59.00</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     56.50-58.00</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     53.00-56.00</p>
<p>Sows:  mostly 0.50 to 1.00 lower, instances 1.50 lower. Top 48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-550 lbs	47.50</p>
<p>	   550-700 lbs	48.00</p>
</text>
